# Records docs/demo.gif with vhs (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs).
# Run from the project root, with your API keys set: vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1000
Set Height 640
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type `web-search "What's new in Python 3.14?"`
Enter
Sleep 35s
